\**{c=red:Notes:}** If you have started the Quest {q:Making Headlines|Making Headlines|Making Headlines} there may be complications with trying to start this Quest:
* This Quest can be completed with {q:Making Headlines|Making Headlines|Making Headlines} active, however {n:Hiwon-Biwon}'s Scoop is taken before this Quest is started.
* The Quest will not show up in your log until after you have spoken to both {n:Hiwon-Biwon} and {p:Shantotto}, zoned out, and then returned to speak to {p:Shantotto} again when she requests the items.

=2 Walkthrough
You must wait one game day and zone after completing the previous Quest before you can activate this Quest.
* Speak to {n:Hiwon-Biwon} (K-8).
* Speak to {p:Shantotto} (K-8).
* Zone out of the area and then back and speak to {p:Shantotto} (K-8).
* For her first question, choose either answer. For her second question, choose "__No way! Not on your life!__" (top option).
** Your {p:title|Title} will become "__Tarutaru Murder Suspect__."
* {p:Shantotto} asks you to bring her 2 {@i:Bomb Arm|17316} {p:Bomb Arms|Bomb Arm}, 1 {@i:Revival Root|940} {i:Revival Tree Root|Revival Tree Root|940}, and 1 {@i:Hiwon's Hair|552} {i:Hiwon's Hair|Hiwon's Hair|552}.
** To obtain {i:Hiwon's Hair|Hiwon's Hair|552}, speak to {n:Hiwon-Biwon} again.
* Trade the items to {p:Shantotto} to complete the Quest.

